{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_016LNdADSCjXbAP7U8AQuwB2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## rnd-v10 â€” Build Trio Session Summary\n\n**Goal:** Build the Anchor R&D Surface v10 \"Live Handoff & Boneyard\" â€” paste-NOT-submit stage handoffs, grass workbench enhancements, and a per-project Boneyard â€” over 8 Foreman waves on branch `foreman/rnd-surface-v10` (off master `b33c74a`, baseline GREEN 1068).\n\n### Grounded claims\n\n- **Wave 1 (backend) â€” paste-NOT-submit substrate.** Added `paste_prompt=` to `terminal_session.start_session`; the phase-1 seed still auto-submits, but the task prompt is recorded as `pending_paste` and flushed UNSENT exactly once via `_flush_pending_paste` after the greet is observed. Two real defects fixed during review: premature flush (greet marker was a substring of the echoed seed â€” fixed by counting marker occurrences *beyond* the seed's own) and a double-paste TOCTOU race (fixed with compare-and-set under `paths.WRITE_LOCK`). GREEN 1083.\n\n- **Wave 2 (UI) â€” both-artifact advance.** `handoff.build_next_stage_prompt` + `write_next_prompt` write `NEXT-PROMPT.md`; advance/finish paths deliver the prompt as a pending paste instead of an auto-submitted seed. Fixed a North-Star hole where `finish_to_build` marked planning DONE without persisting docs (now `capture_session_docs` before advancing, no reap). GREEN 1094; John signed off 2026-06-17.\n\n- **Wave 3 (UI) â€” two toggleable grass terminals.** Replaced the single shared grass terminal with two per-lane (research + plan) independently collapsible hosts. Fixed a `ReferenceError` on grass Save (deleted `panel` binding) and made Save per-lane. Included systemic flake hardening: `_is_benign_disconnect` makes SSE/WS/HTTP paths return cleanly on client disconnect. GREEN 1102.\n\n- **Wave 4 (UI) â€” grass archive + lineage.** New `effort_history.archive_grass_session` (per-idea archive bundle, idea stays in grass) + `session_registry.grass_origin` stamped/inherited to the chain root. Implemented the board-tile \"from grass\" chip (fixed a `\"plan\"` vs `\"planning\"` column-key bug), dead-chip suppression, and idempotent archive. Added autouse `conftest.py` excepthook harness to deterministically swallow benign daemon-thread teardown exceptions. GREEN 1123.\n\n- **Wave 5 (UI) â€” grass researchâ†’plan live handoff.** `advance_grass_research_to_plan` persists research docs, builds the W2 prompt, opens the contained `(idea,'plan')` dev session linked + paste-pending; honest-negative when no real research doc exists. Fixed develop-plan-FIRST silently dropping the handoff (new `queue_paste` + deliver-on-focus) and grass-dev sessions leaking onto the top strip on reload. GREEN 1136.\n\n- **Wave 6 (backend) â€” NEW `boneyard.py`.** Per-project stdlib index (`record_entry`/`list_entries`/`search`/`get_entry` + `build_session_entry`/`build_grass_entry`), index-not-copy referencing v8-persisted doc rels. Capture wired best-effort: killâ†’`killed`, delete_sessionâ†’`deleted` (before pointers drop, D10), delete_grass_ideaâ†’`grass-deleted`. Fixed double-entry on live-session delete (`kill(_record_boneyard=False)`) and missing W4 archive docs in `build_grass_entry`. GREEN 1151.\n\n- **Wave 7 (UI) â€” Boneyard view.** `GET /api/rnd/boneyard?project_id=&q=` (token-gated) + a \"â˜  Boneyard\" tab with search and source badges; all doc links route through traversal-safe `/artifact`. Fixed a proven stored-XSS attribute breakout in client live-search render (hardened shared `_esc` to full HTML-escape, verified all 24 callers) and a server/client timestamp tz divergence. GREEN 1163.\n\n- **Wave 8 â€” CLI mirror + healthcheck + docs (PROJECT DONE).** Added read-only `anchor.py` mirrors (`rnd boneyard`, `rnd next-prompt`) and `check_rnd_v10_surface` (7-step, fully stubbed, hermeticity-asserted). Caught a missing-regression-test-files gap (added `test_cli_v10.py` +20, `test_healthcheck_v10.py` +6) and fixed two doc-overclaims in CLAUDE.md. **GREEN 1189 passed, 1 skipped.**\n\n### Outcome\n- **All 8 waves GREEN.** Every wave passed an EXECUTE â†’ 2-independent-refute REVIEW â†’ FIX â†’ orchestrator-run GATE loop, with every fix proven non-vacuous (test fails pre-fix).\n- **Status:** Branch `foreman/rnd-surface-v10` complete and ready, but **NOT merged or deployed** â€” no merge to master / no `nssm restart anchor` until John signs off the whole branch.\n\n### Errors/risks surfaced and resolved\n- Multiple genuine review-caught defects (premature paste flush, double-paste race, grass Save crash, dropped develop-plan-first handoff, top-strip leak, double boneyard entry, stored-XSS in search render) â€” each reproduced and fixed.\n- Recurring streaming-test flakiness (`WinError 10053`, \"closed file\" `ValueError`) was systemically hardened in both product and test fixtures."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":638,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8548,"cache_read_input_tokens":80607,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8548},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fdac8212-2a2b-4816-af58-548fdfc38b79","uuid":"8e687edf-8f3c-4e22-8639-29faf534a3f4","request_id":"req_011CcBop1Z9ZrS4vchPss4Rd"}
